flowchart TD
  Start([Start]) --> WhileTrue{while True}

  WhileTrue -- true --> ListensForBytes[wait for new bytes]
  ListensForBytes --> CheckDelimiter{is the byte a 0x00 delimiter?}
  CheckDelimiter -- yes --> SendFrame[package byte array as a frame and send it to the frame queue]
  SendFrame --> WhileTrue
  CheckDelimiter -- no --> StoreBuffer[store the byte in a buffer]
  StoreBuffer --> WhileTrue
